#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:141
msgid "Highly-Available (HA) Deployment"
msgstr "Highly-Disponible (HA) Deployment"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:143
msgid ""
"If desired, multiple distributed worker nodes may be associated to the same "
"|morpheus| appliance to eliminate a single point of failure should a "
"distributed worker node go down. Configure each distributed worker node "
"using the same worker key (process described in the prior section) and add "
"redundancy using as many additional workers nodes as needed. When multiple "
"worker nodes are using the same worker key, proxy calls will always go "
"through the primary worker node when possible. The primary node is the first"
" worker node configured using a specific worker key. When necessary, "
"automatic failover will take place and another active worker node will be "
"used. While proxy calls will always try to use the primary node when "
"available, |morpheus| Agent communications can be balanced equally across "
"worker nodes by placing a VIP in front of your distributed workers."
msgstr ""
"Si desired, múltiples distributed worker nodes puede be associated a el "
"mismo |morpheus| appliance a eliminate a single point de failure debería a "
"distributed worker node go down. Configure cada distributed worker node "
"usando el mismo worker key (process described en el prior sección) y agregar"
" redundancy usando as muchos adicional workers nodes as needed. Cuando "
"múltiples worker nodes son usando el mismo worker key, proxy calls va a "
"always go a través de el primary worker node cuando possible. El primary "
"node es el first worker node configurado usando a específico worker key. "
"Cuando necessary, automatic failover va a take place y another active worker"
" node será usado. While proxy calls va a always try a usar el primary node "
"cuando disponible, |morpheus| Agent communications puede ser balanced "
"equally a través de worker nodes por placing a VIP en front de su "
"distributed workers."
